g-widest text-zinc-500">1M+ trades scored</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wallet h-4 w-4 text-[#4A90E2]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4h-3a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1"></path><path d="M3 5v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h15a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4"></path></svg><span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500">Non-custodial security</span></div></div></section><section id="features" class="border-b border-[#1A1F2E]/5 py-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] space-y-20 px-4 md:px-8"><div class="flex flex-col items-end justify-between gap-8 md:flex-row"><div class="space-y-2"><h2 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.5em] text-[#4A90E2]">Product_Ecosystem</h2><h3 class="font-sans text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter">Built for Copy Trading</h3></div><p class="max-w-md text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">Every trader carries a Copy Score. Copy from your feed, or run a Trader Bot on someone you trust — every tool is designed to help you copy with confidence.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="group flex flex-col border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all hover:border-[#1A1F2E]"><div class="mb-6 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center bg-[#4A90E2] text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-activity h-6 w-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2"></path></svg></div><h3 class="mb-3 font-sans text-xl font-black uppercase leading-none tracking-tight transition-colors group-hover:text-[#4A90E2]">Copy Feed</h3><p class="mb-6 flex-grow text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">Your Follow Feed shows live trades from traders you trust, each one carrying that trader&#x27;s Copy Score. Fire Feed widens it to every trader we track, not just the ones you follow.</p><a class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest transition-all group-hover:gap-3" href="/feed">Enter Feed<!-- --> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-[#4A90E2]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="group flex flex-col border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all hover:border-[#1A1F2E]"><div class="mb-6 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center bg-[#4A90E2] text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users h-6 w-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg></div><h3 class="mb-3 font-sans text-xl font-black uppercase leading-none tracking-tight transition-colors group-hover:text-[#4A90E2]">Copy Traders</h3><p class="mb-6 flex-grow text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">Every trader shows a Copy Score: what following them has left after costs, on the trades that reached a result. See it, read why, then decide.</p><a class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest transition-all group-hover:gap-3" href="/discover">Explore Traders<!-- --> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-[#4A90E2]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="group flex flex-col border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all hover:border-[#1A1F2E]"><div class="mb-6 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center bg-[#4A90E2] text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap h-6 w-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="mb-3 font-sans text-xl font-black uppercase leading-none tracking-tight transition-colors group-hover:text-[#4A90E2]">Copy Bots</h3><p class="mb-6 flex-grow text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">A Trader Bot copies one trader you chose, with your own rules and full risk controls. Runs 24/7, and warns you before it starts on a trader whose score does not clear costs.</p><a class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest transition-all group-hover:gap-3" href="/bots">Explore Bots<!-- --> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-[#4A90E2]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class="border-b border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-[#1A1F2E] py-24 text-white"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] space-y-20 px-4 md:px-8"><div class="flex flex-col items-end justify-between gap-8 md:flex-row"><div class="space-y-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><h2 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.5em] text-[#4A90E2]">Copy_Score</h2><span class="border border-[#5CB85C]/30 bg-[#5CB85C]/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#5CB85C]">Free</span></div><h3 class="font-sans text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter text-white">Profitable Isn&#x27;t<br/>The Same As Copyable.</h3></div><p class="max-w-md text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">Copy Score is one number per trader: what following them has left over, after everything it costs to follow them. Free on every profile and every trade card.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="group flex flex-col border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6 transition-all hover:border-[#4A90E2]"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center bg-[#4A90E2] text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-target h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg></div><div class="border border-[#4A90E2]/30 bg-[#4A90E2]/10 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#4A90E2]">COST</div></div><div class="mb-6"><h4 class="mb-2 font-sans text-xl font-black uppercase leading-none tracking-tight text-white">Profit Is Not The Point</h4><p class="text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">A trader can make money and still be a bad copy. You fill worse than they do, you pay venue fees, and you pay us. Copy Score subtracts all of it and asks what is left for you.</p></div><div class="mt-auto space-y-3 border-t border-white/10 pt-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500">SUBTRACTED</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-white">Slippage + fees</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500">UNIT</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-white">Per finished trade</span></div></div></div><div class="group flex flex-col border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6 transition-all hover:border-[#4A90E2]"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center bg-[#4A90E2] text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-target h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg></div><div class="border border-[#4A90E2]/30 bg-[#4A90E2]/10 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#4A90E2]">EVIDENCE</div></div><div class="mb-6"><h4 class="mb-2 font-sans text-xl font-black uppercase leading-none tracking-tight text-white">Finished Trades Only</h4><p class="text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">We measure trades that reached a result, not open positions marked at today&#x27;s price. Under our evidence floor we say we cannot tell, rather than pick a number.</p></div><div class="mt-auto space-y-3 border-t border-white/10 pt-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500">WINDOW</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-white">90 days</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500">IF_UNSURE</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-white">We abstain</span></div></div></div><div class="group flex flex-col border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6 transition-all hover:border-[#4A90E2]"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center bg-[#4A90E2] text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-target h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg></div><div class="border border-[#4A90E2]/30 bg-[#4A90E2]/10 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#4A90E2]">FLAGS</div></div><div class="mb-6"><h4 class="mb-2 font-sans text-xl font-black uppercase leading-none tracking-tight text-white">Some Styles Do Not Copy</h4><p class="text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">Market makers earn the spread you would be paying. Arbitrage needs both sides at once. Very high frequency is gone before your copy fills. We flag those three, beside the score rather than inside it.</p></div><div class="mt-auto space-y-3 border-t border-white/10 pt-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500">TYPES_FLAGGED</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-white">3</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500">FLAG_VS_SCORE</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-white">Separate</span></div></div></div></div><div class="text-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#4A90E2] px-12 py-5 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white transition-all hover:bg-white hover:text-[#1A1F2E]" href="/feed">See Copy Score in Action <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-2 inline h-[18px] w-[18px]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="overflow-hidden bg-[#FAFAFA]/50 py-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-4 md:px-8"><div class="mb-12 flex flex-col items-end justify-between gap-8 md:flex-row"><div class="space-y-4"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#1A1F2E] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#5CB85C]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg>POLYMARKET_LEADERBOARD</div><h3 class="font-sans text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter">See who you could be following</h3><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500">Top Traders by ROI (Last 30 Days)</p></div><a class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#4A90E2] px-8 py-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white shadow-lg transition-all hover:bg-[#1A1F2E] hover:text-[#4A90E2]" href="/discover">Discover Traders <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-[18px] w-[18px]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="relative"><div class="flex gap-6 overflow-x-auto pb-8 pl-4" style="scrollbar-width:none"><div class="min-w-[300px] animate-pulse border border-[#1A1F2E]/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-4"><div class="h-12 w-12 bg-zinc-200"></div><div><div class="mb-2 h-4 w-24 bg-zinc-200"></div><div class="h-3 w-16 bg-zinc-200"></div></div></div><div class="mb-6 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-y border-[#1A1F2E]/5 py-4"><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div></div><div class="h-12 bg-zinc-100"></div></div><div class="min-w-[300px] animate-pulse border border-[#1A1F2E]/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-4"><div class="h-12 w-12 bg-zinc-200"></div><div><div class="mb-2 h-4 w-24 bg-zinc-200"></div><div class="h-3 w-16 bg-zinc-200"></div></div></div><div class="mb-6 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-y border-[#1A1F2E]/5 py-4"><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div></div><div class="h-12 bg-zinc-100"></div></div><div class="min-w-[300px] animate-pulse border border-[#1A1F2E]/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-4"><div class="h-12 w-12 bg-zinc-200"></div><div><div class="mb-2 h-4 w-24 bg-zinc-200"></div><div class="h-3 w-16 bg-zinc-200"></div></div></div><div class="mb-6 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-y border-[#1A1F2E]/5 py-4"><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div></div><div class="h-12 bg-zinc-100"></div></div><div class="min-w-[300px] animate-pulse border border-[#1A1F2E]/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-4"><div class="h-12 w-12 bg-zinc-200"></div><div><div class="mb-2 h-4 w-24 bg-zinc-200"></div><div class="h-3 w-16 bg-zinc-200"></div></div></div><div class="mb-6 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-y border-[#1A1F2E]/5 py-4"><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div></div><div class="h-12 bg-zinc-100"></div></div><div class="min-w-[300px] animate-pulse border border-[#1A1F2E]/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-4"><div class="h-12 w-12 bg-zinc-200"></div><div><div class="mb-2 h-4 w-24 bg-zinc-200"></div><div class="h-3 w-16 bg-zinc-200"></div></div></div><div class="mb-6 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-y border-[#1A1F2E]/5 py-4"><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div></div><div class="h-12 bg-zinc-100"></div></div><div class="min-w-[300px] animate-pulse border border-[#1A1F2E]/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-4"><div class="h-12 w-12 bg-zinc-200"></div><div><div class="mb-2 h-4 w-24 bg-zinc-200"></div><div class="h-3 w-16 bg-zinc-200"></div></div></div><div class="mb-6 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-y border-[#1A1F2E]/5 py-4"><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="h-8 bg-zinc-100"></div></div><div class="h-12 bg-zinc-100"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="overflow-hidden border-t border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-white py-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-4 md:px-8"><div class="mb-12 flex flex-col items-end justify-between gap-8 md:flex-row"><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#1A1F2E] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#4A90E2]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mouse-pointer-click h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 4.1 12 6"></path><path d="m5.1 8-2.9-.8"></path><path d="m6 12-1.9 2"></path><path d="M7.2 2.2 8 5.1"></path><path d="M9.037 9.69a.498.498 0 0 1 .653-.653l11 4.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.074.949l-4.349 1.041a1 1 0 0 0-.74.739l-1.04 4.35a.5.5 0 0 1-.95.074z"></path></svg>COPY_TRADES</div><span class="border border-[#5CB85C]/30 bg-[#5CB85C]/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#5CB85C]">Free</span></div><h3 class="font-sans text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter">See a trade. Copy it.</h3><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500">Browse your feed, spot a trade you like, and copy it in two clicks.</p></div><a class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#4A90E2] px-8 py-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white shadow-lg transition-all hover:bg-[#1A1F2E] hover:text-[#4A90E2]" href="/feed">Open Your Feed <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-[18px] w-[18px]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="group flex flex-col border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-[#FAFAFA] p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:border-[#4A90E2]"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center bg-[#4A90E2] text-white transition-colors group-hover:bg-[#1A1F2E]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-activity h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2"></path></svg></div><div class="border border-[#4A90E2]/20 bg-[#4A90E2]/10 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#4A90E2]">BROWSE</div></div><div class="mb-6"><h4 class="mb-2 font-sans text-xl font-black uppercase leading-none tracking-tight">Live Feed</h4><p class="text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">Trades from the traders you follow stream into your feed in real time. Filter by market, size, or price to find the ones that match your thesis.</p></div><div class="mt-auto space-y-3 border-t border-[#1A1F2E]/5 pt-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">UPDATES</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-[#1A1F2E]">Real-time</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">DATA_WINDOW</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-[#1A1F2E]">Last 24 hours</span></div></div></div><div class="group flex flex-col border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-[#FAFAFA] p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:border-[#4A90E2]"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center bg-[#4A90E2] text-white transition-colors group-hover:bg-[#1A1F2E]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-target h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg></div><div class="border border-[#4A90E2]/20 bg-[#4A90E2]/10 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#4A90E2]">PICK</div></div><div class="mb-6"><h4 class="mb-2 font-sans text-xl font-black uppercase leading-none tracking-tight">Your Call</h4><p class="text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">Every trade shows the trader&#x27;s stats, the market, price, and position size. You decide which trades are worth copying — nothing happens without your approval.</p></div><div class="mt-auto space-y-3 border-t border-[#1A1F2E]/5 pt-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">COPY_SCORE</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-[#1A1F2E]">Per trade</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">CONTEXT</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-[#1A1F2E]">Full stats</span></div></div></div><div class="group flex flex-col border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-[#FAFAFA] p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:border-[#4A90E2]"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center bg-[#4A90E2] text-white transition-colors group-hover:bg-[#1A1F2E]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg></div><div class="border border-[#4A90E2]/20 bg-[#4A90E2]/10 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#4A90E2]">COPY</div></div><div class="mb-6"><h4 class="mb-2 font-sans text-xl font-black uppercase leading-none tracking-tight">Two Clicks</h4><p class="text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">Hit Copy, confirm your size, done. Your order goes straight to Polymarket. Track it from your portfolio.</p></div><div class="mt-auto space-y-3 border-t border-[#1A1F2E]/5 pt-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">EXECUTION</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-[#1A1F2E]">Instant</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">CONTROL</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-[#1A1F2E]">You set the size</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="overflow-hidden border-t border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-[#FAFAFA]/50 py-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-4 md:px-8"><div class="mb-12 flex flex-col items-end justify-between gap-8 md:flex-row"><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#1A1F2E] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#5CB85C]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg>AUTO_COPY_BOTS</div><span class="border border-[#4A90E2]/30 bg-[#4A90E2]/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#4A90E2]">Premium</span></div><h3 class="font-sans text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter">Set it once. Copy 24/7.</h3><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500">Pick a trader, set your rules. Polycopy auto-copies their trades.</p></div><a class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#4A90E2] px-8 py-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white shadow-lg transition-all hover:bg-[#1A1F2E] hover:text-[#4A90E2]" href="/auto-copy-bots">Create a Trader Bot <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-[18px] w-[18px]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="group flex flex-col border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:border-[#4A90E2]"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center bg-[#4A90E2] text-white transition-colors group-hover:bg-[#1A1F2E]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg></div><div class="border border-[#5CB85C]/20 bg-[#5CB85C]/10 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#5CB85C]">PICK</div></div><div class="mb-6"><h4 class="mb-2 font-sans text-xl font-black uppercase leading-none tracking-tight">Any Trader</h4><p class="text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">Browse the leaderboard and pick any trader to mirror. Copy multiple at once. Switch any time.</p></div><div class="mt-auto space-y-3 border-t border-[#1A1F2E]/5 pt-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">TRADERS_AVAILABLE</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-[#1A1F2E]">50K+</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">PER_BOT</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-[#1A1F2E]">1 trader</span></div></div></div><div class="group flex flex-col border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:border-[#4A90E2]"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center bg-[#4A90E2] text-white transition-colors group-hover:bg-[#1A1F2E]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-target h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg></div><div class="border border-[#5CB85C]/20 bg-[#5CB85C]/10 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#5CB85C]">TUNE</div></div><div class="mb-6"><h4 class="mb-2 font-sans text-xl font-black uppercase leading-none tracking-tight">Your Rules</h4><p class="text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">Risk profile, max per trade, allocation rules, stop loss — full controls. Conservative, moderate, aggressive, or No filter (loosest) to start.</p></div><div class="mt-auto space-y-3 border-t border-[#1A1F2E]/5 pt-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">COPY_SCORE_FLOOR</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-[#1A1F2E]">A – D</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">MAX_PER_TRADE</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-[#1A1F2E]">You set it</span></div></div></div><div class="group flex flex-col border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:border-[#4A90E2]"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center bg-[#4A90E2] text-white transition-colors group-hover:bg-[#1A1F2E]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-activity h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2"></path></svg></div><div class="border border-[#5CB85C]/20 bg-[#5CB85C]/10 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#5CB85C]">EXECUTE</div></div><div class="mb-6"><h4 class="mb-2 font-sans text-xl font-black uppercase leading-none tracking-tight">Always On</h4><p class="text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">Every qualifying trade copies in real time. Pause, edit, or stop the bot whenever you want.</p></div><div class="mt-auto space-y-3 border-t border-[#1A1F2E]/5 pt-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">EXECUTION</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-[#1A1F2E]">Real-time</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">UPTIME</span><span class="text-xs font-black text-[#1A1F2E]">24/7</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="border-b border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-[#FAFAFA]/50 py-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] space-y-16 px-4 md:px-8"><div class="space-y-2 text-center"><h2 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.5em] text-[#4A90E2]">Challenges</h2><h3 class="font-sans text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter">Sound Familiar?</h3></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex flex-col border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm"><h4 class="mb-3 font-sans text-lg font-black uppercase leading-tight tracking-tight text-[#1A1F2E]">Too many traders, no way to know who’s good</h4><p class="mb-6 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">Polymarket has thousands of traders. Most tools show you a leaderboard and leave you to guess. A big P&amp;L tells you nothing about whether copying that trader would have paid you anything.</p><div class="mt-auto border-t border-[#4A90E2]/10 pt-4"><p class="text-sm font-bold leading-relaxed text-[#1A1F2E]">Copy Score answers that directly: what following them has left after the cost of following them, on the trades that reached a result.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm"><h4 class="mb-3 font-sans text-lg font-black uppercase leading-tight tracking-tight text-[#1A1F2E]">You can’t watch Polymarket all day</h4><p class="mb-6 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">Good trades happen around the clock. You’re asleep, at work, or just not looking. By the time you see a trade worth copying, it’s too late.</p><div class="mt-auto border-t border-[#4A90E2]/10 pt-4"><p class="text-sm font-bold leading-relaxed text-[#1A1F2E]">Trader Bots run 24/7. Pick a trader, set your rules. The bot copies their qualifying trades automatically.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm"><h4 class="mb-3 font-sans text-lg font-black uppercase leading-tight tracking-tight text-[#1A1F2E]">Blind copying is a bad idea</h4><p class="mb-6 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">Most copy trading tools mirror everything a wallet does. Winners, experiments, mistakes. No filter, no context, no control.</p><div class="mt-auto border-t border-[#4A90E2]/10 pt-4"><p class="text-sm font-bold leading-relaxed text-[#1A1F2E]">Every trade on Polycopy shows the trader’s data. You decide what to copy. A Trader Bot applies your filters to every trade before it executes.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm"><h4 class="mb-3 font-sans text-lg font-black uppercase leading-tight tracking-tight text-[#1A1F2E]">Overall stats hide the real signal</h4><p class="mb-6 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">A trader with a 60% win rate sounds decent. But that number doesn’t tell you whether they’re good at politics trades, NBA props, or crypto. It’s an average that hides the variance.</p><div class="mt-auto border-t border-[#4A90E2]/10 pt-4"><p class="text-sm font-bold leading-relaxed text-[#1A1F2E]">Trader profiles break down performance by market type, bet structure, and price range. You see where someone’s edge actually lives.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="how-it-works" class="border-y border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-white py-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-4 md:px-8"><div class="mb-16 space-y-4 text-center"><h3 class="font-sans text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter">Get started in 3 simple steps</h3><p class="font-medium text-zinc-500">No experience required. Start copying trades in minutes.</p></div><div class="relative mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 gap-12 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 hidden h-[1px] w-full -translate-y-12 bg-[#1A1F2E]/5 md:block"></div><div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center space-y-6 text-center"><div class="relative flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-[#FAFAFA] shadow-sm"><div class="absolute -left-3 -top-3 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center bg-[#4A90E2] text-xs font-black italic text-white">01</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wallet h-8 w-8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4h-3a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1"></path><path d="M3 5v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h15a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4"></path></svg></div><div><h4 class="mb-2 font-sans text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight">Connect</h4><p class="max-w-[200px] text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500">Link your Polymarket account securely in seconds</p></div></div><div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center space-y-6 text-center"><div class="relative flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-[#FAFAFA] shadow-sm"><div class="absolute -left-3 -top-3 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center bg-[#4A90E2] text-xs font-black italic text-white">02</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-user-plus h-8 w-8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><line x1="19" x2="19" y1="8" y2="14"></line><line x1="22" x2="16" y1="11" y2="11"></line></svg></div><div><h4 class="mb-2 font-sans text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight">Find</h4><p class="max-w-[200px] text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500">Browse and follow the highest performing traders</p></div></div><div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center space-y-6 text-center"><div class="relative flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-[#FAFAFA] shadow-sm"><div class="absolute -left-3 -top-3 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center bg-[#4A90E2] text-xs font-black italic text-white">03</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mouse-pointer-click h-8 w-8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 4.1 12 6"></path><path d="m5.1 8-2.9-.8"></path><path d="m6 12-1.9 2"></path><path d="M7.2 2.2 8 5.1"></path><path d="M9.037 9.69a.498.498 0 0 1 .653-.653l11 4.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.074.949l-4.349 1.041a1 1 0 0 0-.74.739l-1.04 4.35a.5.5 0 0 1-.95.074z"></path></svg></div><div><h4 class="mb-2 font-sans text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight">Copy</h4><p class="max-w-[200px] text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500">Copy trades in two clicks, or Run a Trader Bot on someone you trust</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-16 text-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#4A90E2] px-12 py-5 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white shadow-xl transition-all hover:bg-[#1A1F2E] hover:text-[#4A90E2]" href="/login?mode=signup">Sign Up Free <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-2 inline h-[18px] w-[18px]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section id="pricing" class="bg-zinc-50 py-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-4 md:px-8"><div class="mb-16 space-y-4 text-center"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#1A1F2E] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#5CB85C]">SUBSCRIPTION_PLANS</div><h3 class="font-sans text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter">Start free, upgrade when ready</h3><p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">Free Polycopy lets you follow traders, copy trades from your feed, read every trader&#x27;s Copy Score, and track your portfolio. Premium unlocks Auto Copy Bots, Fire Feed, and auto-close. A small trading fee (a flat 0.5%) applies to all trades on both tiers.</p></div><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-4xl grid-cols-1 gap-0 pb-12 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex flex-col border-2 border-[#1A1F2E]/5 bg-white p-8 transition-all hover:border-[#1A1F2E]"><div class="mb-8"><h4 class="mb-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-[#4A90E2]">Free Tier</h4><div class="flex items-baseline gap-1"><span class="font-sans text-5xl font-black tracking-tighter">$0</span><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">/ Month</span></div></div><div class="mb-10 flex-grow space-y-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 text-[#5CB85C]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-600">Connect your Polymarket wallet</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 text-[#5CB85C]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-600">Copy trades directly from your feed</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 text-[#5CB85C]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-600">Copy Score on every trader</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 text-[#5CB85C]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-600">Follow Feed — real-time trades from traders you trust</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 text-[#5CB85C]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-600">Portfolio &amp; performance tracking</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center border border-[#1A1F2E]/5 text-[#5CB85C]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-600">Browse &amp; discover 500K+ traders</span></div></div><a class="mt-auto flex w-full items-center justify-center bg-[#1A1F2E] py-5 text-[12px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white transition-all hover:bg-[#242a3b]" href="/login?mode=signup">Start For Free</a></div><div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col border-2 border-[#4A90E2] bg-[#4A90E2] p-8 shadow-2xl md:scale-105"><div class="mb-4 self-end bg-[#1A1F2E] px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#4A90E2]">Popular Choice</div><div class="mb-8"><h4 class="mb-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-white/60">Premium</h4><div class="flex items-baseline gap-1"><span class="font-sans text-5xl font-black tracking-tighter text-white">$30</span><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/60">/ Month</span></div></div><div class="mb-10 flex-grow space-y-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center border border-white/20 text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white">Trader Bots — pick a trader, set your rules</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center border border-white/20 text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white">Fire Feed — the strongest trades from every tracked trader</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center border border-white/20 text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white">Advanced trade cards</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center border border-white/20 text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white">Auto-close positions</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center border border-white/20 text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white">Everything in Free, plus more</span></div></div><a class="mt-auto flex w-full items-center justify-center bg-[#1A1F2E] py-5 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#4A90E2] transition-all hover:bg-[#242a3b]" href="/login?mode=signup">Start 7-day free trial</a></div></div><div class="space-y-3 text-center"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400">A trading fee applies to all trades on both tiers (a flat 0.5%).<!-- --> <a class="underline hover:text-zinc-600" href="/terms">Full terms</a>.</p></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#1A1F2E] py-24 text-white"><div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-12 px-4 text-center md:px-8"><h3 class="font-sans text-4xl font-black uppercase leading-tight tracking-tighter sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">Polymarket data is noisy.<br/><span class="text-[#4A90E2]">Polycopy is the filter.</span></h3><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 pt-8 text-left md:grid-cols-2"><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[#5CB85C]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest">INDUSTRIAL_SECURITY</span></div><p class="font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">Non-custodial execution. Your keys, your capital. We provide the intelligence and automation layer. You stay in control.</p></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[#4A90E2]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-target h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg><span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest">PRECISION_DATAFEED</span></div><p class="font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">Copy Score reads a trader&#x27;s finished trades, subtracts what following them costs, and tells you what would have been left. Built from 1M+ real trades, and it says so when the evidence is too thin to call.</p></div></div><div class="pt-12"><a class="inline-flex px-16 py-6 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-[#1A1F2E] bg-white transition-all hover:bg-[#4A90E2] hover:text-white" href="/login?mode=signup">Sign Up Now</a></div></div></section><section class="border-t border-[#1A1F2E]/10 bg-white py-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 text-center md:px-8"><p class="font-body text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">Polycopy is an independent third-party tool and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Polymarket. Nothing on this page constitutes financial, investment, or trading advice. Past performance does not guarantee future results. All trading involves risk of loss. A trading fee applies to all trades executed through Polycopy (a flat 0.5%).<!-- --> <a class="underline hover:text-zinc-600" href="/terms">Full terms</a>.</p></div></section><footer class=" bg-poly-black text-white"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 md:grid-cols-5"><div class="md:col-span-1"><div class="mb-5"><span class="inline-flex"><img alt="Polycopy" width="180" height="36" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" src="/logos/polycopy_logo_horizontal.svg"/></span></div><p class="font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/80">The home for copy trading on Polymarket.</p></div><div><h3 class="mb-5 font-sans text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-poly-yellow">PRODUCT</h3><ul class="flex flex-col gap-3"><li><a class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white/80 transition-c